[00:00.00] 作词 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:00.00][by:莫鹿]
[00:00.00] 作曲 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:14.99]‘Round the clock we battled hard all year
[00:14.99]一年到头我们无时无刻不在征战
[00:20.60]Soaked ourselves in sweat, our blood and our tears
[00:20.60]汗流浃背、血肉模糊、泪流满面
[00:26.93]Conquerors we end up gathered here
[00:26.93]我们最终得胜，相聚于此
[00:32.71]Unified but soon we say goodbye
[00:32.71]融为一体，但转瞬即将分离
[00:37.69]When tomorrow becomes today
[00:37.69]这就是明日变为今日的时刻
[00:43.56]
[00:47.68]Some wanna change the world
[00:47.68]有的人想改变世界
[00:50.62]Some just want the fame
[00:50.62]有的就想要个名声
[00:53.60]Some might choose to disappear
[00:53.60]有的干脆选择消失
[00:56.49]While the rest of us remain
[00:56.49]剩下我等留在这里
[00:58.80]
[00:59.55]When the night gives way to morning
[00:59.55]当黑夜褪去，让位给黎明
[01:02.40]We will go our separate ways
[01:02.40]我们将各奔东西
[01:04.93]Let’s make this
[01:04.93]来吧，今夜
[01:10.45]Our night to celebrate
[01:10.45]让我们一起欢庆
[01:13.57]
[01:26.64]Sentimental air becomes so thick
[01:26.64]善感的空气变得那么浓厚
[01:32.70]Movers, shakers, wanderers in our midst
[01:32.70]我们中的鼓动者、摇摆者、迷茫者
[01:38.62]Commit to memory every single face
[01:38.62]牢记每一张脸
[01:44.52]Wish the best and leave the rest to fate
[01:44.52]给予最美的祝愿，剩下的听天由命
[01:50.08]Say farewell tonight
[01:50.08]今夜，告别之夜
[01:55.55]
[01:59.66]Some try to face the truth
[01:59.66]有人努力面对真相
[02:02.51]Some would rather live a lie
[02:02.51]有人却宁可在虚伪中生活
[02:05.63]Most of us will spend our years
[02:05.63]而我们大多在两者之间
[02:08.39]Treading both sides of the line
[02:08.39]反复徘徊，终了一生
